  "Description": "Tools for shaping the world and working in it. Settings are under Options > MKI Tools: hand crafting and mining multipliers, health regeneration, movement speed, flight mode, extra inventory slots, collecting nearby items, Fill Depot from inventory, short conveyor lifts, elevation and length readouts, dismantling unused supports, the chainsaw cutting boulders and its clearance radius, the object scanner's range and vegetation regrowth. Also: hold E for a second to toggle the game's auto pickup (the game's \"Auto-Pickup Active\" label shows while it is on), and a Terrain dismantle mode for level rocks, arches and cliffs (hidden, never deleted, and restorable).",
